    {
     "id": "/page/0/Text/11",
     "block_type": "Text",
     "html": "<p>If instead we change the decoration of <math>\\rho_0</math> to <math>\\theta_1 + \\dots + \\theta_n</math>, then the resulting affine charts have coordinate superalgebras</p>",
